<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[Crankcase Extended Idle Exhaust (process 17) at County (SINGLE) scale.

Process 17 is chained to extended-idle exhaust (process 90), so THC/CO/NOx
extended idle (190/290/390) are selected as its parents. Runs hourID 7 (key="6";
keys are hourID-1) on road types 1 (Off-Network) and 4. The county input DB
(washtenaw_cdb, from county-inputs/washtenaw-county/setup-hotelling.sql) supplies
the hotelling inputs (hotellingHoursPerDay, hotellingActivityDistribution) plus the
population, VMT and fuel-supply tables MOVES does not copy from the default DB at
SINGLE scale (sourceTypeAgeDistribution, HPMSVtypeYear, fuelSupply, from the
default DB's own Washtenaw 2020 rows).]]></description>
